      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CUT FROM ABOVE (7) is a first starter from the John Chapman kennel by Tommy Shelby out of Silver Scissors. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Strong market watch advised but profiles nicely for this. ZIPPING NICKEIL (5) did a good job to finish third last time out over 320m at this track (19.13) in a Maiden, the second top-three finish on the trot. Can find the frame this time. FAST FOOTWORK (2) finished towards the tail latest and yet to show much in two runs. Better than last start and can bounce back. NOT TOO PROUD (1) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
